  "authority_rules": [
    "Confirmation is decided ONLY by CanonicalConfirmationService",
    "Confirmation is NEVER authorization and NEVER completion",
    "Confirmed resume revalidates authorization (recheck_authorization) and binding identity (_binding_identity_valid); failure -> non-executing outcome",
    "Only VerificationGate + MissionCompletionGate can produce canonical COMPLETED",
    "Rejection -> MissionEngine.reject -> canonical CANCELLED; never executes",
    "Free-form text (e.g. 'sim') never reaches the confirm handler -> zero execution",
    "Typed confirm is the ONLY resume path",
    "Expired/consumed/replayed confirmations never execute",
    "UNKNOWN product responses never expose execution evidence (mission_id)"
